# eol pins for content-hashed / byte-compared artifacts (P3.9.5).
# prompt.md is copied into builds and content-hashed by ncc's asset pipeline
# (the hash becomes the dist asset FILENAME) - a CRLF checkout on Windows
# would hash differently than Linux CI and fail the dist-freshness gate.
packages/drift-engine/src/prompt.md text eol=lf
# The committed action bundle is byte-compared against a fresh Linux build.
apps/action/dist/** text eol=lf
